=== gameday-plan.md (excerpt) ===
experiment: disk stall on kv-2 (every fsync of kv-2's write-ahead log delayed by 2 s)
hypothesis: the service survives the loss of one replica; success stays >= 99.5 %
evidence:   last month's experiment 'kill kv-2' (09:00, about 900 requests/s): success 100 %
when:       10:40, for 15 minutes      scope: production, all clients
abort:      the operator stops the experiment if the dashboard looks bad

=== client configuration (excerpt) ===
timeout_ms = 250   max_attempts = 3   retry_target = any_replica   retry_budget = none

